0. Overall licence: GNU GPL v3
------------------------------
Emod is a fork of Eden: World Builder's source code. Per community records (old Discord
posts), Ari Ronen released that source in 2018 under the GNU General Public License v3.
This has NOT been confirmed in writing by Ari Ronen (ROADMAP LG.1). On that basis Emod as
a whole - the combined, compiled program and every binary package - is distributed under
the GPL v3 (see COPYING). Recipients get the source (github.com/hagg3/Emod) and the
GPL's freedoms. Emod's own files may also be used on their own under the MIT licence
(section 2), which is GPL-compatible.

1. Eden-derived material
------------------------
Eden: World Builder is (c) Ari Ronen / Kingly Games. The following are derived from
